    [
     {
      "type": "textmedia",
      "header": "",
      "body": "<h3>ZOLLER is known for its experienced team of over 800 people, innovative manufacturing technology, and its down-to-earth nature as a third-generation family business.</h3>",
      "images": [],
      "videos": [],
      "pos": "text",
      "cols": 1,
      "valign": "top",
      "ftype": "text",
      "id": "c718",
      "bg": "",
      "space": {
       "before": "default",
       "after": "default"
      }
     }
    ],
    [
     {
      "type": "textmedia",
      "header": "",
      "body": "<p><strong>Outstanding precision, simple operation, and high quality define our products and actions. With more than 800 employees in 62 countries, our team has a diverse variety of skills, ideas, cultures, and languages. The value of this diversity for our corporate culture and development potential cannot be overestimated.</strong></p> <p>We see ourselves as a cosmopolitan, technology-oriented family business. Our roots lie in the down-to-earth nature of the SME sector, and our growth is based on interaction, innovation, and the willingness to shape progress.</p> <p>ZOLLER is present wherever machining, toolmaking, and tool grinding are important economic factors. We offer a globally unique system of tool measuring technology, inspection technology, tool management, software, and automation. This system makes every production process more efficient.</p> <p>ZOLLER customers come from all industries where machining processes and cutting tools significantly contribute to value—including automotive, aerospace, medical technology, mechanical engineering, plant engineering, and mold making.</p>",
      "images": [],
      "videos": [],
      "pos": "text",
      "cols": 1,
      "valign": "top",
      "ftype": "text",
      "id": "c719",
      "bg": "",
